  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The Russian IPY Science Plan for 2007-2008 includes investigations at the meso-scale polygon in the vicinity of the North Pole to carry out physical, chemical and biological measurements of the Transarctic sea ice out-flow (e.g. transport of water mass, snow/ice thickness, nutrients, contaminants and biological tracers). This dataset presents the sea ice biota collected at the North Pole."
